  "detailed_description": "The scheme “Floriculture Development Scheme” was launched by the Department of Agriculture &amp;amp; Farmers’ Welfare, Government of Meghalaya to motivate the farmers to take up floriculture (traditional and non-traditional flowers) as a commercial venture through the distribution of planting materials and other inputs.\n",
  "eligibility": "\n   1. The applicant/farmer should be a permanent resident of Meghalaya.\n   1. The applicant should be a bonafide farmer engaged in agriculture.\n\n",
  "exclusions": null,
